  "name": "Question 4",
  "problem": "The concentration of solute of a certain chemical solution is normally distributed with a mean of $20\\,\\text{mg/ml}$ and a standard deviation of $1\\,\\text{mg/ml}.$ Suppose $50$ bottles of this solution are randomly selected. What is the probability that the mean concentration for this sample will be more than $19.9\\,\\text{mg/ml},$ but less than $20.1\\,\\text{mg/ml}?$\n\n*Hint: A table of values of $Φ(z)$ for different values of $z$ is given below, where $Φ(z)$ is the cumulative distribution function for the standard normal distribution. *\n\n<table align=\"center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr> \n  <th width=\"25%\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$z$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.00\\,$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.01\\,$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.02\\,$</th>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-0.7\\,$</th>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2420\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2389\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2358\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-0.6\\,$</th>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2743\\,$ </td>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2709\\,$ </td>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2676\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-0.5\\,$</th>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3085\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3050\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3015\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></th>\n<th width=\"5%\"></th>\n\n<th><p></p>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr> \n  <th width=\"25%\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$z$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.00\\,$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.01\\,$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.02\\,$</th>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.5\\,$</th>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6915\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6950\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6985\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.6\\,$</th>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.7257\\,$ </td>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.7291\\,$ </td>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.7324\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.7\\,$</th>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.7580\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.7611\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.7642\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></th>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
